<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0595_T25R1004_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo. I love STRONG homies.\rI feed ’em Pre-Workout to crank\ntheir Attack. My homie been up for\ffour days.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0595_T25R1004_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m a bad guy, I admit it. I jaywalk.\rBut I NEVER liked hangin’ around bad\nones like The Feds. They too much.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0595_T25R1004_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A Kevlar Vest boost your homie’s\nDefense. I wear one to family\freunions.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0595_T25R1004_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Feds... What you doin’ here?\nShoppin’ for evidence?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0595_T25R1004_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Some homies only evolve when you\ntrade ’em.\rI know four: MACHOKE, KADABRA,\nHAUNTER, and, um, GRAVELER.\fThat’s all I got. I failed science.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0595_T25R1004_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Even The Feds wouldn’t seize their\nown homies’ homies... right? RIGHT?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0595_T25R1004_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let Us Pump Up Your Homies!\n4F Medicine Box</language>
	</row>
</body>
